WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.916 --> 00:00:02.541
- RISE AND GRIND. NO DAYS OFF.

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.416
- OH NO. EVERYONE AT MY SMALL GATHERING, WE OVERSLEPT.

00:00:05.541 --> 00:00:08.166
- Ugh, I ate three almonds last night. What happened?

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.000
Uh-oh.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.208
- WHOOPS, I BOUGHT A BASEBALL TEAM?

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:13.750
- Hello, city inspector. What’s that? 

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.541
You’re coming in one hour?!

00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:18.583
WE NEED TO CLEAN UP, OR WE CAN’T PLAY. QUICK, SEND A DISTRACTION!

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:21.500
- I’m local miracle Alex Smith! Focus on me!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:22.708
- What if we delay—

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.791
- NO, WE’RE STICKING TO SCHEDULE. 

00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:25.958
DAN, CHANGE YOUR NAME. THE SPONSORS CARE NOW. 

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.583
- Uh, we're the...Washington...

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:29.041
Football...

00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:30.375
Team.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.750
Dwayne, hurry, make a mascot.

00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:33.458
- Jamal, change into something presentable!

00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:36.083
- What about player safety? Gridiron Heights has an active volcano!

00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:39.875
- Fine, for volcano safety, we’ll ban jersey swaps. 

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:40.875
- Aww. 

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:44.000
- Get up! Or stay down. I respect you now! 

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:46.250
Hey—Hey, why don't we go turn Gronk back on.

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:48.291
- PLEASE SET TIME ON GRONK.

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:49.875
- I’m here to see if the town is to code.

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:52.208
- [Together:] Everything is fine here!

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:52.875
- Interesting.

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.750
- Introducing our new mascot:

00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:57.291
- [Together:] WE’RE TEAMY THE TEAM MONSTER.

00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.833
- Ok, so you're good to play football.

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:05.583
- If you thought this video was a homerun, hit the subscribe button.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:06.583
- What?

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.875
- You don’t wanna strike out on future episodes. 

00:01:09.416 --> 00:01:10.541
- Uh, Kyler, this is a football thing.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.791
- I’ll see you at the World Series.

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:14.291
- Can he not hear me down there?

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:16.375
- Alright thanks for letting me stand on this chair.

